MSP Flasher is an open-source, shell-based interface for programming MSP devices
through a FET programmer or eZ430 via JTAG or Spy Bi-Wire (SBW). MSP Flasher can
be used to download binary files (.txt/.hex) directly to the target memory
without the need of an IDE like CCS or IAR.

It can also be used to extract firmware directly from a device and blow the JTAG
fuse.
